message: "If you use Galileo in your teaching, research or writing, please cite it as below."
title: "iGalileo: Galileo in Jupyter and in the browser"
abstract: "iGalileo brings the Galileo computer algebra system to Jupyter notebooks and to the browser (a playground and JupyterLite), with interactive lessons from arithmetic to number theory, chaos and differential geometry."
